    ,
      "why": "Same 1/cycle throughput as pipelined but registers every m stages, trading a little latency for fewer FFs and a higher Fmax (shorter combinational chains). This is the main lever for the power_index objective and for pushing area down at the same accuracy, so it should populate the low-power / low-FF region of the front that pipelined alone may miss."
    },
